==Battleground==
*25 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**6 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Now is probably one of the best times to bring out [[Bondage Cat (Special Cat)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]]. With [[Talents]], they basically become a second Roe Cat, which is always decent against Professor A. For your attackers, bring Long Distance units that outrange Professor A. or something that can tank their way in, like [[Li'l Fish Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Island Cat]].

